# 5. Review Scope

Stage 03 QA must review the **entire passage**.

It is not sufficient to inspect:

- a few sentences;
- the opening;
- only the RS requirement;
- only word count;
- only factual correctness.

The review must evaluate both:

```text
Contract compliance
+
Learner-facing quality
```

A passage must pass both.

