# 7. Upstream Certification Verification

Before reviewing passage quality, verify that the passage was derived from an approved Stage 02 Content Job.

Confirm:

```text
Stage02 QA status = PASS
```

and that the Content Job used by Stage 03 is the approved version.

If the source Content Job is uncertified, mismatched or unavailable:

```text
BLOCKED
```

The passage cannot be certified.

