# 45. QA Role Boundary

Stage 03 QA may:

- inspect;
- compare;
- challenge;
- fact-check;
- analyze;
- identify defects;
- classify severity;
- identify upstream causes;
- define acceptance criteria;
- certify;
- move the approved exact artifact after PASS.

Stage 03 QA must not:

- rewrite the passage;
- directly fix wording;
- generate replacement sentences;
- create a substitute passage;
- change the Content Job;
- weaken requirements;
- silently correct the artifact and approve the corrected version.

