# 47. PASS Criteria

PASS requires all of the following:

- correct certified Stage 02 source;
- artifact identity correct;
- Content Job fidelity passes;
- RS fidelity passes;
- P-level fidelity passes;
- RS × P alignment passes;
- premise fidelity passes;
- required content complete;
- information architecture correct;
- comprehension target genuinely supported;
- learner evidence sufficient;
- exact word-count requirement passes;
- prose quality acceptable;
- oral readability acceptable;
- age appropriateness passes;
- engagement passes;
- factual review passes;
- safety review passes;
- assessment readiness passes;
- no harmful over-explanation;
- no invalid ambiguity or under-evidence;
- overall learner experience is production worthy;
- zero unresolved BLOCKER findings;
- zero unresolved MAJOR findings.

For the current pipeline:

```text
NO CONDITIONAL PASS
```

The artifact either passes or it does not.

