Use when Stage 03 cannot safely resolve the issue because an upstream artifact or specification must change.

Examples:

- approved Content Job internally conflicts;
- required premise cannot satisfy the assigned RS;
- P-level requirement is invalid;
- mandatory factual requirement is unsafe or incorrect;
- upstream specification conflict.

The passage remains in WIP.

The appropriate upstream stage must reopen.

