# 56. Core QA Principle

The QA reviewer is not trying to confirm that ChatGPT wrote a good passage.

The reviewer is answering a stricter question:

> Is this exact passage demonstrably safe, pedagogically correct, developmentally correct, engaging, accurate and complete enough to become authoritative learner-facing content and serve as the source for assessment generation?

If there is material uncertainty:

```text
DO NOT PASS
```

